{"type":"message","id":"8b255f32","parentId":"b1ff7cca","timestamp":"2026-03-25T11:05:01.361Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0f51f1416f5248a30169c3c15772a08191976266ff43bd58c4\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpw8FYPQVPfR1wGEMChBh6LPrYJ4W7_vT9oEou5-ILbrPkRZljCRT3N_ZJdF5JF45bX2XZOQoEqP7tSXMcr9Rmb4dLvxiL3Gn0UswVrANexwozz5DphBhDwIk0wyRANNweLQEqV1uNpeVsUZAQlGtBo2TJEesjxfyplXjXCyDAj6fsDi5Cm_K6rr2XvsiQzrch2hewlPB40TY-QbGqyGut2HLYhZsHG51uhGohBTvEpm9J9TTmhwLwISlsOe3pZcRsNKhH_9dH5bxzI5B9VnsrB3CiGIZJJjOd77TCpNU4tyBw0WEuFe7czrwYCrhzMrr7y31nVV69vRCV-fLwbFVmapGNF8zVV5ypHPp2ruMGxhRta8S6NzhaR64zA55yraofE10RozoM9GhlSy__Qkuvfft36WrVe-d1vFVw7ahhATp4TcTbgpNMUebrVIOZFFl_gyn2wj-xbeiIQpSPx1nrgkFGVdQo9_X_VooEqH3333F-1kUlpOaFmDu46kaGhovIJeI-XaNCqTYzRVkuzoay4PzLNvEAQwcf6yYbTDzuLkq_lWaE_Byxc1-zT8gobRiKIvnQbPUUlBdE2uooksrC3kJdDVsRhL8VfZK_PpfZ0JLICbIQHwjWNro3EOXBbutHcXf96gFAr7E_lbwerHgAw_xua9VdjBovyCEg_VRNDass9OTvxfguC7LHzzT3Mw7x-4N3qmS944oSAy0YQ2M1d4Vopwcy6k82-CZXDM0T72QJYQHO6v-OCS4g9adyh72u8f3yG188RTR5iXUYQDrDZbE9dBR_8hPt7kXcEEKs8lal9edPz9K04Vn2iWMEqVqJEoDIIR0mlO8eTeqFg0ftUldvT_RrAPtQr79Vd2HF4mnz6jajd2yXWH91qGVnzaYZSjI5uYVseYkp5rBK-xbk07M1J-5Uccmhs44IhTLqq345bMGzyXF0jjZTQOTSsayZLLCU\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Yes — that could be very useful here.\n\nI checked for a stored note about that prior instruction, but I did **not** find a matching memory snippet in the available memory store. Given your current symptoms, the most helpful next step on my side would be to review or run analysis on the **actual CT image**.\n\n**What you can do**\nPlease **send/upload the CT scan image file here** if you have it available.\n\n**Why it matters**\nWith your history and current symptoms, a kidney CT could help add more context alongside:\n- your **worsening right-sided back/flank pain**\n- **pink urine**\n- **burning urination**\n- **temperature fluctuations**\n- prior **RCC / nephrectomy / CKD follow-up**\n\n**Suggested tool/skill use**\nOnce you upload the CT image, I can run the **kidney pipeline** on it and give you a structured summary of:\n- **Kidney Cancer Detector**\n- **Image Analyzer**\n- **xAI interpretation**\n\nThat output would still be a **preliminary signal, not a diagnosis**, but it may help us interpret the scan more clearly while you pursue medical evaluation.\n\nIf you want, **send the CT image now** and I’ll proceed.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0f51f1416f5248a30169c3c15840e48191a4e210c0d9431130\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":175,"output":289,"cacheRead":35200,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35664,"cost":{"input":0.0004375,"output":0.004335,"cacheRead":0.008799999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0135725}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774436692266}}
